on":1,"rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5855776,"review":"The most amazing few days in El Gouna! The apartment was spotless and the Mangroovy complex was lovely! The host was extremely responsive and helpful! Thank you!","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5863404,"review":"Все отлично","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5904989,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5936437,"review":"Spacious home, very well furnished with an amazing view \nWill definitely choose it again","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6080638,"review":"Extremely disappointing experience.\n\nI booked this property because it was advertised as a 4-bedroom house, but upon arrival I discovered it was actually only 3 proper bedrooms and the “fourth room” was a maid’s room that was initially locked.\n\nI spent hours contacting the host and management team trying to solve the issue instead of enjoying my vacation. From around 5:30 PM until almost 10:00 PM, I was left waiting for responses and solutions after a long trip, while traveling with my one-year-old child.\n\nThe handling of the situation was very unprofessional. Different employees kept changing the arrangements and promises, and the next morning I was asked to pay extra money for a solution to a problem that was caused by the misleading listing itself.\n\nTo make matters worse, the property description was later changed from 4 bedrooms to 3 bedrooms after my complaint.\n\nOverall, this stay caused unnecessary stress, wasted a large part of my vacation, and was far below expectations. not re","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6081299,"review":"Absolutely loved our stay! I highly recommend Xuru Stays, the team was extremely helpful, very very responsive and were very accommodating to all of our requests.\n\nThe place was clean and in a perfect location with a beautiful garden and Easy access to the beach and pool with all the needed amenities by a walking distance.\n\nAmazing team, we’ll be visiting again!","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6129970,"review":"Everything was perfect","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6132486,"review":"The stay was great overall. The property was clean, comfortable, well-suited for families, and exactly as described. The location was excellent, and the host was helpful and responsive throughout our stay. We really enjoyed our time there.","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6157552,"review":"Positive:\nClean and have all what we need\n\nNegative:\nNo thing","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6158732,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":250288,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}